<title>NEW ZEALAND: Anvil Mining sells Max holding.</title>
<headline>Anvil Mining sells Max holding.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anvil Mining said in a notice to the New Zealand Stock Exchange on Tuesday that it had ceased to be a substantial security holder in Max Resources Ltd on January 6.</p>
<p>Anvil, which previously had a 5.11 percent holding in Max, no longer held a relevant interest in the company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
